promote digestive health and support immune health!* This robust formula is loaded with a powerful blend of the best nutrient- and antioxidant-dense whole foods that nature has to offer."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"With an assortment of ingredients and essential nutrients derived from over 30 beneficial whole foods, SuperFoods 25 Plus Probiotics gives you a hearty helping of natural goodness in every easy-to-mix, great-tasting serving."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"NATURAL PROTEIN BLEND\nContains 25g of protein derived from protein-rich ingredients such as soy, brown rice and flaxseed. *"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Protein supports metabolism and lean muscle tone.* Adequate amounts of dietary protein also support satiety, helping you feel fuller longer."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"SUPER GREENS BLEND\nIncludes 2g of nutrient-dense garden and sea greens including alfalfa, spinach, and kelp."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"EXOTIC SUPER FRUITS BLEND\nDelivers 4g of antioxidant-rich super fruits including acai, papaya, and pomegranate."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Based upon air-dried fruits and vegetables."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"To ensure a complete nutritional program, take daily with these GNC products:\nPremium GNC Multivitamin\nChewy D-3 Soft Chews\nTriple Strength Fish Oil"},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"Vegetarian"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"SCAN & LEARN MORE"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not indented to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"25 Grams Whole Food-Based Protein"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PLUS PROBIOTICS"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL - DELICIOUS \nSUPERIOR MIXABILITY"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 991474 COG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Age Daily Dose Servings Fruits & Vegetables Protein Probiotics\n5-12 1 scoop 1/2 12.5g 6 billion\n13-18 1-2 scoops 1/2 - 1 12.5 - 25g 6 - 12.5 billion\n18+ 2 scoops 1 25g 12.5 billion"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Tree Nuts (Lichee Nut)."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Flavors, No Artificial Colors, No Added Sugar."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"F1125301"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Supports nutrient metabolism & lean muscle tone*\nProvides probiotic cultures & enzymes to help improve digestive health*\nLoaded with fiber, vitamins & minerals"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, mix 2 scoops (38.1g) with 8-10 fl. oz. of water. Stir briskly or shake well in a closed container until completely mixed. The amount of liquid may vary depending on thickness desired."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Tree Nuts (Lichee Nut)."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."}],"targetGroups":["Vegetarian","Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 12594 3","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}